WEBVTT

14:33.232 --> 14:37.653
and whose ship had
sails of colored silk.

14:38.988 --> 14:40.990
So...

14:42.074 --> 14:44.577
have you seen one?

14:44.702 --> 14:47.705
- A pirate ship?
- A dragon.

14:48.706 --> 14:50.749
No.

14:50.875 --> 14:54.378
No, the last one died
many years before I was born.

14:55.337 --> 14:57.548
I'll tell you what I have seen -

14:58.591 --> 15:00.843
their skulls.
